  (text "LM27761: VOUT = -1.22 V x (1 + 1.54M/499k) = -4.99 V. Pump output resistance 2 ohm, LDO dropout\n30 mV at 100 mA (datasheet): needs VIN >= 5.2 V at 90 mA -> fed from the 5.32 V boost.\nFerrite + 10 uF after the LDO to keep pump residue (~MHz) off the BUF802." (at 254 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 47455622-74ac-5663-a650-5c7eec4c07b1))
