  (text "+2V5: LP5907 (6.5 uV rms) from +5V4F. -2V5: LM337, -1.25 V x (1 + 120/120) = -2.50 V,\n120R divider = 10 mA minimum load; 10 uF on ADJ lowers noise. Output cap: >= 10 uF (ESR-tolerant)." (at 165.1 226.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6b33e7ca-bb44-5fac-8ea3-e34cc109042f))
  (text "Load estimate (A): +3V3 0.45 (TRF37D73 6 x 55 mA, FPGA, MS5351M, COS3502 x 8, LVDS rx),\n+1V2 0.03, +5V 0.04, -5V 0.09 incl. -2V5 0.04, +2V5 0.05, VBUS direct 0.2 (GVA-84+ x 2).\nVBUS total ~0.85 A." (at 19.05 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f2e5fe0e-1525-513a-923a-fcfe577bd5b3))
